      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think the issue might be that VRChat just shrinks a blocked player into a tiny 0-sized speck, which you normally can't reasonably select with a cursor. However on a touchscreen, your finger tap is basically a shotgun blast, hitting everything in that general area of where you are tapping on the screen. So you are basically selecting a very hard to select person.\n\nIf my theory is correct, the issue could likely be easily solved by making blocked users not selectable when clicked on. `if (selectedPlayer.IsBlocked) continue;`",
