  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I was in an instance with a user that had me blocked. I was confused when I tapped the screen where the person was supposedly standing and the quick menu popped up with their profile. It seemed to happen when I tapped where the person's feet supposedly were.\n\nIt was a group public instance where I had instance moderation powers, and I don't know if that is related to reproducing this issue.\n\n1. Be in group instance with instance moderation powers.\n\n2. Have a user, that has you blocked, stand somewhere you can find\n\n3. Tap the screen where their feet would be\n\nI will see about testing it without instance moderation powers.",
